    "data": "{\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"chatcmpl-tool-9100fa5c4728730d\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Sails\\\\Documents\\\\Workspace\\\\01-Active\\\\Core-Systems\\\\OpenOxygenClaw\\\\README.md\"},\"output\":\"<path>C:\\\\Users\\\\Sails\\\\Documents\\\\Workspace\\\\01-Active\\\\Core-Systems\\\\OpenOxygenClaw\\\\README.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: # OpenOxygenClaw\\n2: \\n3: > Standalone AI Agent Core - Separated from WebUI for better architecture\\n4: \\n5: ## Architecture\\n6: \\n7: ```\\n8: OpenOxygenClaw/\\n9: ├── packages/\\n10: │   ├── core/           # Core agent engine (ODC, OMM, MCP, containers)\\n11: │   ├── cli/            # Command-line interface\\n12: │   ├── gateway/        # Smart LLM routing & API management\\n13: │   ├── shared/         # Shared utilities, types, icons\\n14: │   └── api-server/     # REST API server for WebUI integration\\n15: └── README.md\\n16: ```\\n17: \\n18: ## Separation from WebUI\\n19: \\n20: The WebUI is **completely separated** from the core:\\n21: \\n22: ```\\n23: AgentWorkspace/\\n24: ├── OpenOxygenClaw/           # Core + CLI + API Server\\n25: │   ├── packages/core/        # Agent runtime\\n26: │   ├── packages/cli/         # CLI commands\\n27: │   ├── packages/gateway/     # Model routing\\n28: │   ├── packages/api-server/  # REST API for WebUI\\n29: │   └── packages/shared/      # Shared code\\n30: │\\n31: └── oxygen-claw/              # WebUI (separate project)\\n32:     └── packages/webui/       # React Material 3 Dashboard\\n33: ```\\n34: \\n35: ## API Endpoints\\n36: \\n37: The API Server exposes these endpoints for WebUI:\\n38: \\n39: | Method | Endpoint | Description |\\n40: |--------|----------|-------------|\\n41: | GET | `/api/health` | Health check |\\n42: | GET | `/api/models` | List all models |\\n43: | GET | `/api/models/current` | Get active model |\\n44: | POST | `/api/models/switch` | Switch model |\\n45: | GET | `/api/models/suggest?q=<query>` | Search models |\\n46: | GET | `/api/models/history` | Model usage history |\\n47: | POST | `/api/models/import` | Import models from JSON |\\n48: | POST | `/api/tasks` | Create task |\\n49: | GET | `/api/tasks` | List tasks |\\n50: | GET | `/api/tasks/:id` | Get task |\\n51: | GET | `/api/mcp/servers` | List MCP servers |\\n52: \\n53: ## Quick Start\\n54: \\n55: ### 1. Start API Server\\n56: \\n57: ```bash\\n58: cd OpenOxygenClaw\\n59: npm install\\n60: npm run dev\\n61: ```\\n62: \\n63: Server runs on `http://localhost:3001`\\n64: \\n65: ### 2. Start WebUI (separate project)\\n66: \\n67: ```bash\\n68: cd ../oxygen-claw/packages/webui\\n69: npm install\\n70: npm run dev\\n71: ```\\n72: \\n73: WebUI runs on `http://localhost:5173`\\n74: \\n75: ## Communication Flow\\n76: \\n77: ```\\n78: WebUI (React) → HTTP/REST → API Server → Core Engine\\n79: ```\\n80: \\n81: WebUI never directly imports `@openoxygenclaw/core`. All communication goes through the REST API.\\n82: \\n83: ## Benefits of Separation\\n84: \\n85: 1. **Independent Deployment**: Core can run on a server, WebUI on client\\n86: 2. **Technology Freedom**: WebUI can be replaced with any frontend (React, Vue, mobile app)\\n87: 3. **Scalability**: API Server can be scaled independently\\n88: 4. **Security**: Core logic hidden behind API, no direct access\\n89: 5. **Maintainability**: Clear separation of concerns\\n90: \\n91: ## Model Switching\\n92: \\n93: Models are managed through the API:\\n94: \\n95: ```bash\\n96: # Switch model via API\\n97: curl -X POST http://localhost:3001/api/models/switch \\\\\\n98:   -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\" \\\\\\n99:   -d '{\\\"modelName\\\": \\\"gpt-4o\\\"}'\\n100: \\n101: # Get current model\\n102: curl http://localhost:3001/api/models/current\\n103: \\n104: # Search models\\n105: curl \\\"http://localhost:3001/api/models/suggest?q=gpt\\\"\\n106: ```\\n107: \\n108: ## CLI Usage\\n109: \\n110: ```bash\\n111: # Run CLI (uses core directly)\\n112: cd OpenOxygenClaw\\n113: npm run cli -- run \\\"Hello world\\\" --mode expert\\n114: \\n115: # Switch model via CLI\\n116: npm run cli -- models --switch gpt-4o\\n117: ```\\n118: \\n119: ## Development\\n120: \\n121: ### Core Development\\n122: ```bash\\n123: cd OpenOxygenClaw/packages/core\\n124: npm run dev\\n125: ```\\n126: \\n127: ### API Server Development\\n128: ```bash\\n129: cd OpenOxygenClaw/packages/api-server\\n130: npm run dev\\n131: ```\\n132: \\n133: ### WebUI Development\\n134: ```bash\\n135: cd oxygen-claw/packages/webui\\n136: npm run dev\\n137: ```\\n\\n(End of file - total 137 lines)\\n</content>\",\"metadata\":{\"preview\":\"# OpenOxygenClaw\\n\\n> Standalone AI Agent Core - Separated from WebUI for better architecture\\n\\n## Architecture\\n\\n```\\nOpenOxygenClaw/\\n├── packages/\\n│   ├── core/           # Core agent engine (ODC, OMM, MCP, containers)\\n│   ├── cli/            # Command-line interface\\n│   ├── gateway/        # Smart LLM routing & API management\\n│   ├── shared/         # Shared utilities, types, icons\\n│   └── api-server/     # REST API server for WebUI integration\\n└── README.md\\n```\\n\\n## Separation from WebUI\\n\\nThe WebUI is **completely separated** from the core:\",\"truncated\":false,\"loaded\":[],\"display\":{\"type\":\"file\",\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Sails\\\\Documents\\\\Workspace\\\\01-Active\\\\Core-Systems\\\\OpenOxygenClaw\\\\README.md\",\"text\":\"# OpenOxygenClaw\\n\\n> Standalone AI Agent Core - Separated from WebUI for better architecture\\n\\n## Architecture\\n\\n```\\nOpenOxygenClaw/\\n├── packages/\\n│   ├── core/           # Core agent engine (ODC, OMM, MCP, containers)\\n│   ├── cli/            # Command-line interface\\n│   ├── gateway/        # Smart LLM routing & API management\\n│   ├── shared/         # Shared utilities, types, icons\\n│   └── api-server/     # REST API server for WebUI integration\\n└── README.md\\n```\\n\\n## Separation from WebUI\\n\\nThe WebUI is **completely separated** from the core:\\n\\n```\\nAgentWorkspace/\\n├── OpenOxygenClaw/           # Core + CLI + API Server\\n│   ├── packages/core/        # Agent runtime\\n│   ├── packages/cli/         # CLI commands\\n│   ├── packages/gateway/     # Model routing\\n│   ├── packages/api-server/  # REST API for WebUI\\n│   └── packages/shared/      # Shared code\\n│\\n└── oxygen-claw/              # WebUI (separate project)\\n    └── packages/webui/       # React Material 3 Dashboard\\n```\\n\\n## API Endpoints\\n\\nThe API Server exposes these endpoints for WebUI:\\n\\n| Method | Endpoint | Description |\\n|--------|----------|-------------|\\n| GET | `/api/health` | Health check |\\n| GET | `/api/models` | List all models |\\n| GET | `/api/models/current` | Get active model |\\n| POST | `/api/models/switch` | Switch model |\\n| GET | `/api/models/suggest?q=<query>` | Search models |\\n| GET | `/api/models/history` | Model usage history |\\n| POST | `/api/models/import` | Import models from JSON |\\n| POST | `/api/tasks` | Create task |\\n| GET | `/api/tasks` | List tasks |\\n| GET | `/api/tasks/:id` | Get task |\\n| GET | `/api/mcp/servers` | List MCP servers |\\n\\n## Quick Start\\n\\n### 1. Start API Server\\n\\n```bash\\ncd OpenOxygenClaw\\nnpm install\\nnpm run dev\\n```\\n\\nServer runs on `http://localhost:3001`\\n\\n### 2. Start WebUI (separate project)\\n\\n```bash\\ncd ../oxygen-claw/packages/webui\\nnpm install\\nnpm run dev\\n```\\n\\nWebUI runs on `http://localhost:5173`\\n\\n## Communication Flow\\n\\n```\\nWebUI (React) → HTTP/REST → API Server → Core Engine\\n```\\n\\nWebUI never directly imports `@openoxygenclaw/core`. All communication goes through the REST API.\\n\\n## Benefits of Separation\\n\\n1. **Independent Deployment**: Core can run on a server, WebUI on client\\n2. **Technology Freedom**: WebUI can be replaced with any frontend (React, Vue, mobile app)\\n3. **Scalability**: API Server can be scaled independently\\n4. **Security**: Core logic hidden behind API, no direct access\\n5. **Maintainability**: Clear separation of concerns\\n\\n## Model Switching\\n\\nModels are managed through the API:\\n\\n```bash\\n# Switch model via API\\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:3001/api/models/switch \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\" \\\\\\n  -d '{\\\"modelName\\\": \\\"gpt-4o\\\"}'\\n\\n# Get current model\\ncurl http://localhost:3001/api/models/current\\n\\n# Search models\\ncurl \\\"http://localhost:3001/api/models/suggest?q=gpt\\\"\\n```\\n\\n## CLI Usage\\n\\n```bash\\n# Run CLI (uses core directly)\\ncd OpenOxygenClaw\\nnpm run cli -- run \\\"Hello world\\\" --mode expert\\n\\n# Switch model via CLI\\nnpm run cli -- models --switch gpt-4o\\n```\\n\\n## Development\\n\\n### Core Development\\n```bash\\ncd OpenOxygenClaw/packages/core\\nnpm run dev\\n```\\n\\n### API Server Development\\n```bash\\ncd OpenOxygenClaw/packages/api-server\\nnpm run dev\\n```\\n\\n### WebUI Development\\n```bash\\ncd oxygen-claw/packages/webui\\nnpm run dev\\n```\",\"lineStart\":1,\"lineEnd\":137,\"totalLines\":137,\"truncated\":false}},\"title\":\"Users\\\\Sails\\\\Documents\\\\Workspace\\\\01-Active\\\\Core-Systems\\\\OpenOxygenClaw\\\\README.md\",\"time\":{\"start\":1786820688147,\"end\":1786820688188}}}"
